mations without getting boxed in. Knowing where to move and when to move is just as important as dealing damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/d40853b8db4a36f2a7ebd67688808d9f.poster.avif?t=1787887968\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/d40853b8db4a36f2a7ebd67688808d9f.webm?t=1787887968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/d40853b8db4a36f2a7ebd67688808d9f.mp4?t=1787887968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Something Ridiculous</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up perks and upgrades throughout your run and see what you can put together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine bonuses, improve your abilities, and look for synergies that can turn a decent build into something completely overpowered. Every run gives you a different set of options, so try things out and see what works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/1ddfe513768b2579120edaef660dfde6.poster.avif?t=1787887968\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/1ddfe513768b2579120edaef660dfde6.webm?t=1787887968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311210/extras/1ddfe513768b2579120edaef660dfde6.mp4?t=1787887968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters, Different Ways to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own abilitie